WEBVTT

00:14:29.209 --> 00:14:32.938
it's a really sad thing to see this gap
and to think about it.

00:14:32.962 --> 00:14:35.363
But the good news is,
there's lots we can do.

00:14:35.904 --> 00:14:39.135
Some of the changes are easy,
some of the changes are more complex.

00:14:39.159 --> 00:14:41.816
But if we'll attack each problem directly,

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:45.312
not by just providing
more information to people

00:14:45.336 --> 00:14:47.075
but trying to change the friction,

00:14:47.099 --> 00:14:48.369
add motivation,

00:14:48.393 --> 00:14:49.690
I think we can ...

00:14:49.714 --> 00:14:51.570
Can we close the gap? No.

00:14:51.594 --> 00:14:54.604
But can we get much better?
Absolutely, yes.

00:14:54.628 --> 00:14:55.844
Thank you very much.

00:14:55.868 --> 00:14:59.628
(Applause)